    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d594-a4-a3">

                <pb facs="0577" n="503" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg503"/>

                <head>No. 3.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[Telegram.—<placeName>Ferroll</placeName>,
                            <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-02-17">17th February</date>, 4h.
                        45m. p. m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Stonewall unable to go out. Much water. Her commander goes to Paris. Her builder
                    is expected from Bordeaux I think she is abandoned. Niagarain port, We receive
                    telegrams.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>FERNANDEZ.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
